  <figure>
    <img src="/assets/images/gone-forever/emerson-institute-opera-house/708-line-sketch-location.jpg" alt="Emerson Institute in an 1883 bird's-eye view of Mandan">
    <figcaption>Enlarged excerpt from the 1883 bird's-eye view of Mandan</figcaption>
